      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9377/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine butternut squash, Yukon Gold potatoes, bell peppers, sweet potato, and red onion pieces in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cZDxiGF9EdEmaIlT8LZlf3miPYg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-RM-9377-roasted-vegetables-ddmfs-step2-3x4-3c365614c36044e6bc1500a0e45af12c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9377/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir olive oil, balsamic vinegar, rosemary, and thyme together in a small bowl; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fukt0ALpYWy63NMQOo5LYxJzPBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-RM-9377-roasted-vegetables-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6ce66ba0f6cd448792d24ae23e2ad428.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9377/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over vegetables and toss until well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s6NsPlLMm7Q5gHljkYf7MjE2LBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-RM-9377-roasted-vegetables-ddmfs-step4-3x4-d755911ee8c648fb8a26db9534e74e1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9377/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer vegetables to a large roasting pan and spread in an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-RjaTWyTYp7_WPFy3LmHZ3L8PIw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-RM-9377-roasted-vegetables-ddmfs-step5-3x4-1e61125c8965487b8783b521ce702a8d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9377/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven, stirring every 10 minutes, until vegetables are slightly caramelized and cooked through, 35 to 40 minutes.",
